  "description": "A client library for Gecko Alliance spa packs over the in.touch2 UDP protocol.\n      Discovers spas on the local network, reads and writes the spa pack structure, and\n      exposes pumps, lights, blowers, the heater, water care and sensors as objects.\n      A C# port of the Python geckolib.\n\n      Licensed GPL-3.0-or-later, inherited from geckolib: software that references this\n      package has to be licensed under the GPL too.",
